WEBVTT

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:19.780
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:21.650
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:26.860
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.760
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:32.190
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:36.600
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:40.140
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:43.470
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:49.140
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:53.640
Sha la la la la...

00:00:54.980 --> 00:01:00.060
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.020
(Secret romance)

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:07.230
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:08.990
(A strange distance)

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:15.840
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:16.910
Yeah

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:20.380
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:24.150
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:29.310
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:54.210
The Karasumori Academy is a private
integrated junior and high school

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:56.780
located in an ordinary suburb in Japan.

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:59.850
It is a school well known
for its excellent academics.

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:05.480
But it has one strange rule:
For some reason...

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:11.120
not a single person is allowed on
school grounds after sundown.

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:17.130
Hey wait!

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:24.000
Why you!

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:32.080
I keep telling you to watch
your surroundings.

00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:34.510
Danger is always around you.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.720
You're the one that's dangerous.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:40.460
Tonight, on campus grounds where
entry is forbidden by others,

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:43.720
Yoshimori and Tokine
continue their fight.

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:46.620
Yoshimori!

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:48.460
You fool!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:52.530
Hurry and wake... up!

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:57.600
Honestly... What do you think
the Kekkai Technique is for?!

00:02:58.270 --> 00:03:01.300
How dare you use it
against your own family?!

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:07.080
Shuji-san! This omelet is so delicious!

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.110
Your use of soup stock is exquisite!

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.390
R-Really?

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:15.120
This fluffy soft texture is so...

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:17.820
You've improved yet again!

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:19.290
I...

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:24.730
prefer my omelets made with
sugar instead of soup stock...

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:26.440
You fool!

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:29.730
When will you grow up to be
an upstanding bearer of the Hoin Mark?!

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:34.430
I'm only doing this
so I can become stronger.

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:36.850
I really don't care about the Hoin Mark

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:38.310
or about being
the Legitimate Heir.

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:43.690
I trust you took down that Ayakashi

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:46.710
and beat that
Yukimura girl last night.

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.360
Who cares about who wins?

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.350
I finished my job and
that's all that counts.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:53.290
Why you! Have you no shame?!

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:57.960
Come on. Father.
Yoshimori is working hard every day.

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.530
You're spoiling him!

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:01.700
This fool here will slack off
all he wants.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:03.260
Unless we keep an eye on him!

00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:05.740
Shuji-san! You only need to
make enough breakfast

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:07.680
for three people starting tomorrow!

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:11.670
You don't need to feed
this foolish boy over here!

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.080
- Yoshimori! You brat!
- Oh...

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.180
- How dare you put up a Kekkai...
- Now. Father...

00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:17.420
- over my favorite food?!
- It's probably just...

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:19.110
- You've already eaten too much!
- Yoshimori, you too...

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:21.480
Anyway, I'm not going to take over
the family profession!

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.060
Okay, I'm off!

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:33.670
H-Hey...

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.700
As always, you have that sulky look
on your face.

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:40.840
Hey! Don't sigh after looking at me!

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:45.550
Stop following me!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:48.350
I can't help it!
We go to the same school!

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:50.980
You're in junior high
and I'm in high school.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.750
We go to different buildings
and different entrances...

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:55.620
But we're in the same exact place.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:57.290
All right already.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:59.950
Just don't talk to me at school
when the sun is up.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:04.830
Yeah. But you're talking to me now.
That's okay?

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:09.200
Stop harassing me first thing
in the morning!

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.670
What?! What's your problem?!

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:12.670
Still holding a grudge that
you lost yesterday?

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:14.770
Not at all...

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:16.110
Then what?

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:20.070
I just want to go to school...

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:22.110
Hey...

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:27.590
I'm good at going that route too!

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:34.850
Don't think you can outrun me!

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:36.990
Stop following me!

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:45.910
What? Going back to the usual route?

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:47.430
That's no fun.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.480
Hm... What's wrong?

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:54.970
I told you to stop following me.

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:58.990
Knock it off. You creep me out.

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:02.620
You creep me out! You creep me out!
You creep me out!

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:18.630
Sumimura-kun is always asleep.

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:22.000
I'm not creepy.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:26.680
You seem to be enjoying your nap time.

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:30.250
Mr. Kurosu, people need sleep
to get away

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:34.520
from the harsh reality of life, right?

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:37.790
Sleep is important, but not naps during...

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:44.350
It was stupid of me to try
to deal with you.

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:45.790
Go ahead and stay asleep!

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:47.600
All right, class. Let's resume!

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:53.500
He's still sleeping.

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:54.940
Of course not!

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:55.640
What?

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.770
Oh, he's just talking in his sleep...

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.110
He can carry on conversations.

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:00.410
He's so creepy.

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:03.340
Creepy?!

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:06.920
Ichigaya, am I creepy?

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:09.050
Yeah... A little...

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:12.630
So, I am creepy.

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:14.590
Hey, Sumimura.

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:17.460
Do you know Yukimura Tokine?

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:20.030
What's with you all of a sudden?!

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:21.770
And why refer to her on
a first-name basis?!

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:24.830
No, I just saw you talking to her.
Like you two were really close.

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:27.610
We're just neighbors.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:28.710
Neighbors?

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:31.510
Awesome! I didn't think I'd have
an information source close by!

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:34.710
So what are her hobbies?

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:35.780
What?

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:37.350
There he goes again.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:40.050
Tabata. A.k.a. The "Information Nerd"!

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:41.910
That's "Information Wizard" to you!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:47.150
Tabata Hiromu, Karasumori Academy's
databank! That's me!

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:51.560
And you want to know what
her hobbies are. Because?

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:52.990
You don't know?

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:55.160
She's really popular.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:58.100
Guys around here think
she's the ideal girl.

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:01.170
Her?! Ideal?

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.610
She's pure and lovely!
Beautiful like a white lily

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:08.670
and her silky flowing hair is
a mystery of the Orient!

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:10.910
White lily?

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:13.250
Don't you mean a tiger lily?

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:17.390
On top of that,
she's honorable and intelligent!

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.530
She treats everyone
with equal kindness!

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:23.400
She's the Heisei-era's Nightingale!

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.030
By the way,

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:27.560
a lot of the male teachers are
secret admirers of her. Or so I hear.

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:29.100
What?!

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:34.340
I never figured monsters were lying
in wait at school during the daytime!

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:36.900
I'll destroy them...
I'll destroy them all!

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:40.710
So since you're a neighbor,
do you have any juicy details for me?!

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:43.910
I don't. And what do you mean
by juicy?!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:45.910
Then what's her family like?

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:49.250
I hear that it's a family of three
with her, her mother and grandmother.

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:50.950
Did her father pass away?

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:51.860
Stop it!

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:55.990
I hate guys that lack telepathy.

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:05.910
Did he mean to say "sensitivity"?

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:08.600
Probably. It's not common
to have telepathy.

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:14.150
What are you looking at, Kanda?

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.140
Oh hi. Sumimura-kun!

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:20.350
Did you know that excessive dieting
is bad for your health?! Bye!

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:21.850
What?

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:26.220
I told you not to come anymore!

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:28.890
Oh. Don't be so stubborn. Son.

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:32.890
You've been dead for 50 years.

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:36.660
No. It can't be...

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:38.770
You don't know how to solve it?

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:40.240
I'm sorry.

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:41.640
Go back to your seat.

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:44.680
I guess it was a bit too difficult.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:46.710
Yukimura-san. How about you?

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:47.510
Yes?

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:49.110
You try.

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:58.930
- Wow!
- That's amazing!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:03.730
All right.

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:07.570
Since Yukimura-san solved
the problem, we'll call it a day.

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:10.390
Stand! Bow!

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:18.100
Wow, Tokine! How did you
solve that problem?!

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:20.540
It just happened to be the one
I was working on last night.

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:25.050
Yukimura-san, do you have a tutor?

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:28.050
If not, I find it impossible for you
to be able to solve that.

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:33.460
Maybe I should ask my father
to get me a better tutor.

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:36.330
Seriously... Mao is such a jerk!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:39.770
So... do you really have a tutor?

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:41.730
No. I don't.

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:43.100
Then you go to cram school?

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:43.860
No.

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:46.300
Then that makes it even more amazing!

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:49.470
You should tell Mao to
shut up next time!

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:52.940
Uh... It's not like we're fighting
or anything...

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:01.390
I'm going to put that plan
into action today!

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:08.090
He always seems to have so much energy
once school is out.

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:09.160
Yup...

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:13.670
The plan is perfect...

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:16.600
Dream...

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:19.470
This fragrance!

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:22.370
Here he comes!

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.170
You western wannabe!

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:25.410
Shut up!

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:29.980
Whoa!

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:31.310
Cheeky little brat!

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:33.650
No one can stop my feelings!

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:35.720
This is all I can do now...

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:38.780
but one day,
I will build a castle of sweets!

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:43.300
I will acknowledge your dream
to build a castle as a man!

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:48.670
But think of the castle of our lord
before all other castles!

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:51.530
Oh, so that's why you're against it!

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:52.900
Don't worry.

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:56.010
I'll build a Karasumori castle too!
Out of sweets!

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:59.710
You fool!
Are you trying to insult our lord?!

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:01.440
Unforgivable!

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:04.150
I'll beat some sense into you!

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:05.750
Bring it on, geezer!

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:08.350
Whoa! How dare you call
your grandfather a geezer!

00:12:08.420 --> 00:12:10.150
Legitimate Heir Chop!

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:13.260
Don't chop at my prototype!

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:15.990
You western wannabe!
Feel my wrath!

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:17.400
It's so peaceful...

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:18.290
Yup.

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:45.620
What is this?

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:48.520
You were mumbling about wanting
to eat this, weren't you?

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:51.800
Dad told me that your mom said so.

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:53.930
So what?

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:56.830
It's a castle made out of sweets!

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:06.440
What?! You don't like
a Himeji castle made of sweet red bean?

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:10.080
Would you rather have it be
made out of mochi rice?

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:11.850
No...

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:14.680
You're really good with your hands.

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.580
It would be a shame to eat it.

00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:18.020
Just try it.

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:24.330
It's good!

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:25.790
Really?!

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:37.340
Yoshimori, keep this a secret
from Grandpa.

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:42.250
What's this?

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:44.320
It's cake. Try some.

00:13:50.190 --> 00:13:52.960
This is great!
I've never eaten anything like this!

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:58.430
I think the castle made of sweets
that Tokine-chan talked about

00:13:58.430 --> 00:14:00.960
is a western-style castle
made out of cake.

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:04.190
But she said it was good...

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:08.370
Maybe that was Tokine-chan being kind?

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:09.440
Huh?

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:19.790
Ever since then my dream was
to make a castle of cake...

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:24.750
I'll get you to eat it someday Tokine!

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:28.530
What is this chill?

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:43.680
Oh, it's still only eight.
I have to work now?!

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:46.600
Hey, get out here.
It's time to work.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:48.420
Oh, be quiet.

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:51.010
You know I don't wake up
unless it's midnight.

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:54.720
What?! You little mutt.
Don't talk like you can't get out of bed!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.310
Just get up!
The enemy is already here!

00:14:57.560 --> 00:15:01.760
Then bring me some fresh venison
with the soul still attached!

00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:04.350
You can't find ones with
the soul attached in the grocery store!

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:07.290
Your sandals are loose.

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.940
That just shows that
you're slacking off too.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:12.130
Now good night.

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:15.540
- Stop spouting nonsense and get out here!
- Hey! Stop it!

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:23.840
My, you're late for work.

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:27.150
I have my own reasons!

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:30.880
How am I supposed to get
that meat with a soul?

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:34.860
You look tired.
I guess I'll win tonight again.

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:37.520
Should I give you a handicap
to make it more even?

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:38.930
Who needs that?!

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:41.190
Besides. I don't want
to compete with you...

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:43.070
Did you wait long, honey?

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:44.830
- Did you find it?
- Of course.

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:46.840
Good job, Hakubi.

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:49.670
Oh hi. Yoshi. You're too late!

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:53.140
Hakubi. Don't tease him so much.
He takes it personally.

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:54.520
Wow, that's annoying!

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:56.040
They already think
they're going to win!

00:15:56.320 --> 00:15:58.380
They think they're winners, "top breeders"?

00:15:58.550 --> 00:15:59.380
Bye!

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:05.090
She's playing dirty with
that smoke bomb!

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:09.690
Oh, be quiet. You can catch up!
Follow me!

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:13.160
We're sprinting already?!

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.900
Just be quiet and run!

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.310
You know, this is all your fault!

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:19.000
This better be the right direction!

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:21.300
Don't underestimate
my sense of smell!

00:16:23.110 --> 00:16:23.870
Over there!

00:16:24.110 --> 00:16:26.100
You were going the wrong direction!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:29.840
I found it! Over there!

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:31.080
Hoi! Joso!

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:31.950
Ketsu!

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:40.320
Hm? Where did it go?

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:43.130
What are you doing?!
You let it get away!

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:45.800
Yoshi! Don't butt in!

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:46.800
Crap!

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:50.930
Ow!

00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:51.960
Dummy...

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:53.030
K-Kai...

00:16:57.510 --> 00:17:00.350
Hakubi, can you tell
the exact location of it from here?

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:03.540
I can't unless I get a little closer.

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:08.550
It wasn't very fast. I can catch it
if I can see where it is.

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:11.960
But if I have to dodge attacks
at the same time...

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:18.270
From above?!

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:18.990
Ketsu!

00:17:33.010 --> 00:17:34.110
Joso! Ketsu!

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:37.350
It's becoming more powerful.

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:41.840
Look! It's absorbing the objects
around it to shoot!

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:50.860
Honey, we should retreat for now...

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.620
Just fending off the attacks
is hard enough...

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:58.460
Oh. look at the time.
It's all because of cram school.

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:04.050
Uh-oh...

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:07.010
I saw something inside the school
when no one's supposed to be there...

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:08.010
I didn't see anything!

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:11.020
I didn't see anything!
I didn't see anything at all!

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:15.410
Tokine!

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:18.350
All right!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:24.720
It's time for me to use
my secret weapon... sneakers!

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:27.800
Hey! You have to wear
the traditional formal attire

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:30.100
designated by Master Tokimori!

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:32.830
Shut up! The times have changed!

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:34.470
Wait. Tokine!

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:35.840
Hey, Yoshimori!

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:41.680
Why aren't you using the Kekkai?!

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:44.610
I can't get in front of her if I do!

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:46.950
Good grief...

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:55.250
Honey, you can do it!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.090
This is bad! I can't keep this up!

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:00.260
If it shoots a big one at me...

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:09.140
What are you doing?

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:10.800
Why aren't you putting up a Kekkai?!

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:13.310
Oh, right. I forgot I could do that.

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:17.050
That thing isn't right for you!

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:18.880
It's mine!

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:20.750
Yoshimori! Wait!

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:25.490
He's moving differently from usual...

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:29.790
He's wearing sneakers!

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.020
Only a little more. Almost in range...

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:35.990
All right!

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:37.660
Hoi! Joso!

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:41.410
Ketsu!

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:42.770
Yes!

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:45.600
Ketsu!

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:50.070
Kai!

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:53.740
You idiot!
What were you thinking?!

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:57.230
You'll need extra lives
if you keep fighting like that...

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:59.820
Hey Tokine, are you okay?

00:20:02.730 --> 00:20:04.250
W-What about you?

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:08.000
I'm fine. Here. Let me borrow this.

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:10.960
Metsu! Tenketsu!

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:15.610
All right!

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:19.180
You really have to stop
being so reckless-

00:20:19.180 --> 00:20:20.980
Thanks! It was a big help.

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:23.210
Where's my stuff?

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:24.740
Are you listening?!

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:28.380
Never mind!

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:31.860
I'm tired of your stupidity!
I really am!

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:37.490
You can have the credit for this.
So clean up the rest.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:40.360
Let's go, Hakubi.

00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:41.560
All right, honey.

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:44.870
Clean up? Oh...

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:47.630
I have to clean all of this up?!

00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:51.380
Crap, she ran away...

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:52.810
Oh well.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.720
Shikigami are beings that take shape

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.950
through the Caster's power.

00:20:57.950 --> 00:21:00.610
Used for guardian/servant purposes.

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:02.460
To the Hazama Style Kekkaishi,

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:05.580
they have an important skill outside
of Kekkai techniques.

00:21:06.060 --> 00:21:07.960
The Restoration Technique.

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:12.200
Because they fight the forces that
are invisible to ordinary people,

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:15.040
they must minimize the trouble
that might affect ordinary people.

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:17.730
That was the philosophy of the founder.
Or so they say.

00:21:23.780 --> 00:21:25.610
Ow! That hurt!

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:27.310
Can't you be a little more gentle?!

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:30.920
It's good you managed
to use the Kekkai techniques

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:34.150
wearing those sneakers,
but you're a real idiot.

00:21:34.260 --> 00:21:35.880
Look at all these cuts and bruises...

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:39.720
You did all this for that girl.

00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:41.960
Do you really think you're protecting her?

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:45.590
Shut up. Don't tell her about it.

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:47.430
I won't tell her even
if you asked me to.

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:52.660
That's the Yukimura's Shikigami.

00:21:55.740 --> 00:21:57.070
So what does it say?

00:21:57.650 --> 00:22:02.120
"This is some special purification ointment
that Grandma made."

00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:04.110
"It"II be good for your bruises..."

00:22:04.890 --> 00:22:07.180
See? She already knows.

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:09.950
Your stubbornness is meaningless.

00:22:10.190 --> 00:22:12.820
Shut up! I don't care
if it doesn't mean anything!

00:22:13.090 --> 00:22:16.060
Well. I don't care either.

00:22:16.130 --> 00:22:21.530
But you better not forget that venison
with a soul you promised me.

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:24.570
Crap! How am I going to get that?!

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:28.300
Nevertheless I never...

00:22:28.840 --> 00:22:32.900
I never want to see her
get hurt ever again.

00:22:38.890 --> 00:22:46.590
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:53.300
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:54.870 --> 00:23:02.680
Joking around I noticed after I laughed

00:23:02.680 --> 00:23:09.010
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:10.950 --> 00:23:18.860
You don't have to say anything it's okay

00:23:20.160 --> 00:23:25.220
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:34.310
Straight ahead I'm pushing forward

00:23:34.310 --> 00:23:41.840
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:50.830
Even if we are near or far

00:23:50.830 --> 00:23:59.390
The red string connects one to another
